    /// phase, force aiming. [`SB_NO_WEAPON_AIM_NOAIM_TRANSITIONS`](state::StateBitFlag::SB_NO_WEAPON_AIM_NOAIM_TRANSITIONS)
    /// keeps the previous result, and [`SB_NO_WEAPON_AIM`](state::StateBitFlag::SB_NO_WEAPON_AIM)
